`,(0,r.jsxs)(s,{children:[(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"I've got your Q1 planning doc in front of me. Let me pull in some fresh research on competitor onboarding flows to supplement what's already in there. I've got a solid picture now. Let me put together your meeting prep."}),(0,r.jsx)(i.h2,{children:"Meeting Prep: The Case for Simplifying Onboarding"}),(0,r.jsx)(i.h3,{children:"Your Current State (from Q1 Doc)"}),(0,r.jsx)(l,{src:n,alt:"Metrics table from the Q1 doc: onboarding completion 34% current vs 60% target (-26pts), time to first value 8.2 min vs under 3 min (5+ min too slow), onboarding steps 7 vs 3 (4 steps to cut), day-7 retention 41% vs 55% (-14pts)"}),(0,r.jsx)(i.p,{children:"Your doc identified three main friction points:"}),(0,r.jsxs)(i.ol,{children:[`
